Modified version: Study with HOYO-MiX, public source edition (synced 2026-11-25).
Changes include the HOYO-MiX study companion interface, Liquid Glass Studio
renderer and adaptive tiles, player recovery and crossfade/Smart Mix transitions,
active multi-provider adapters (ChKSz, LX Music sandbox and global registry,
GD Studio) with retired Jellyfin/Vkeys runtime paths, focus features, community
chat with Durable Objects and D1 retention/moderation, catalogue discovery tools,
and removal of private configuration, operational data and third-party media.
